sequenceDiagram
    actor Analyst
    participant Dashboard as React dashboard
    participant Backend as Spring Boot API
    participant Ingest as Ingestion executor
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant Analysis as Gemini executor
    participant Vertex as Vertex AI / Gemini

    Dashboard->>Backend: WebSocket handshake at /ws/stream
    Analyst->>Dashboard: Select Stream Feed
    Dashboard->>Backend: HTTP POST /api/ingest/start
    Backend-)Ingest: Submit ingestion work if idle
    Backend-->>Dashboard: HTTP 200 start acknowledgement

    Ingest->>Mongo: Look up transaction by ID
    alt Transaction already exists
        Ingest->>Mongo: Save using the existing document ID
    else New validated transaction
        Ingest->>Ingest: Check sender baseline and anomaly rules
        opt Suspected fraud with a sender baseline
            Ingest->>Mongo: Save OPEN case with pending analysis
            Ingest--)Dashboard: WebSocket FRAUD_CASE
            Ingest-)Analysis: Submit background analysis
        end
        par Foreground transaction persistence
            Ingest->>Mongo: Save transaction
            Ingest--)Dashboard: WebSocket TRANSACTION
        and Background enrichment if submitted
            Analysis->>Mongo: Read recent clean sender history
            opt Vertex AI configured and credentials available
                Analysis->>Vertex: HTTPS generateContent with transaction context
                Vertex-->>Analysis: Analysis result or request failure
            end
            opt Vertex request unavailable or failed
                Analysis->>Analysis: Generate simulated analysis
            end
            Analysis->>Mongo: Reload the saved fraud case
            opt Saved case still exists
                opt Risk score above 0.7
                    Analysis->>Backend: Call Java investigation agent in process
                end
                Analysis->>Mongo: Save case analysis
                Analysis--)Dashboard: WebSocket CASE_UPDATE
            end
        end
    end
